				"version": {
					"major": 7,
					"minor": 27,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Iris Diaphragm - mechanical blade iris as overlay source with alpha. Put it on a layer above everything: the blades close over all layers below. Iris Phase (0-100): 0 = open, 50 = closed, 100 = open again; the blades turn while closing and turn back while opening (Blade Twist). Typical: animate Iris Phase 0 -> 100 with the clip Timeline and trigger the clip in Piano mode. Default (Phase 0) is fully transparent. Set Blade Color to white and use this layer as mask (Mask Mode: One Below) to show another clip on the blades. Backdrop On\/Off: On = solid Backdrop Color behind everything, Off = transparent background.",
			"displayName": "Iris Diaphragm",
			"identifier": "d399eacc-8f83-4282-bf81-cbae34481abf",
